host-sflow (2.0.36-1vyatta2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * meson-build.patch: drop the version keyword from the static_library()
    call in meson.build. static_library() has no soname to version, and
    current meson (1.x, as shipped in Debian 13) rejects it as an unknown
    keyword argument instead of ignoring it as older meson did, which broke
    the build outright ("Got unknown keyword arguments 'version'").

